g numbers of full-time fathers will. But based on today\uc1 \u8217 ?s socioeconomic trends, this hope is, unfortunately, misguided.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \qj \fi360 \cufi200 \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl360 \slmult1 \nowidctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af6 \dbch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 It\uc1 \u8217 ?s true that the number of men who have left work to do their thing as full-time parents has doubled in a decade, but ifs still very small}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \'a1G}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1  only 0. }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1028 \langnp1028 \langfe1028 \langfenp1028 \alang1025 \cf1 8% }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 of married couples where the stay-at-home father was out of the labor force for a year. Even that percentage is likely inflated by men thrust into their caretaker role by a downsizing. This is simply not a large enough group to reduce the social stigma(}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \'a6\'c3\'a6W}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 )and force other adjustments necessary to supporting men in this decision, even if only for a relatively short time.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \qj \fi360 \cufi200 \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl360 \slmult1 \nowidctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af6 \dbch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 Even shorter times away from work for working fathers are already difficult. A study found that }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1028 \langnp1028 \langfe1028 \langfenp1028 \alang1025 \cf1 85% }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 of new fathers take some time off after the birth of a child\uc1 \u8212 ?but for all but a few, it\uc1 \u8217 ?s a week or two at most. Meanwhile, the average for women who take leave is more than 10 weeks.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \qj \fi360 \cufi200 \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl360 \slmult1 \nowidctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af6 \dbch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 Such choices impact who moves up in the organization. While you\uc1 \u8217 ?re away}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1028 \langnp1028 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 , }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 someone else is doing your work, making your sales, taking care of your customers. That can\uc1 \u8217 ?t help you at work. It can only hurt you. Women, of course, face the same issues of returning after a long absence. But with many more women than men choosing to leave the workforce entirely to raise families, returning from an extended parental leave doesn\uc1 \u8217 ?t raise as many eyebrows as it does for men.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \qj \fi360 \cufi200 \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl360 \slmult1 \nowidctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af6 \dbch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 Women would make more if they didn't break their earning trajectory }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1028 \langnp1028 \langfe1028 \langfenp1028 \alang1025 \cf1 (}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af1 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af1 \hich \af1 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \'b9\'ec\'bc\'a3}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \'a1^}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 by leaving the workforce, or if higher-paying professions were more family-friendly. In the foreseeable future, stay- at-home fathers may make all the difference for individual families, but their presence won\uc1 \u8217 ?t reduce the numbers of high-potential women who are forced to choose between family and career.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl360 \slmult1 \nowidctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af6 \dbch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 56. What gives women a ray of hope to achieve work-life balance?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs18 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \fi-425 \li425 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \sl360 \slmult1 \nowidctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin425 \rin0 \itap0 \ls3 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af6 \dbch \af6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \alang1025 \cf1 {\listtext \pard \plain \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 